 ential Data\, Federated & Distributed Learning\nSize: XL\nSubmission type
 : Paper-based / mixed tracks\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2
 026-08-20\nNotes: Official SIGKDD and KDD 2026 pages list conference date
 s and research-track Cycle 2 deadlines.\nScope: Knowledge discovery and d
 ata science\, centered on extracting useful structure from large\, hetero
